promptfoo, DeepTeam, the Adversarial Robustness Toolbox, and model and MCP scanners).
Those tools are the property of their respective authors and are distributed under
their own licences; Khandaq does not vendor or relicense them. Each adapter records
the upstream tool, its version and its licence in its adapter.yaml manifest.
